Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ani-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, curl, fzf, grep, sed, mpv | vlc
Recommends: mpv, yt-dlp, ffmpeg
Description: browse and watch anime from the command line
 ani-cli searches for a show, lets you pick an episode with fzf and plays
 it in mpv. It can also download episodes (with yt-dlp or ffmpeg).
 .
 Armatos carries the current upstream release in the horreum: the sites
 ani-cli reads from change often, and Ubuntu's 26.04 copy (4.10) is too old
 to keep up. Updates arrive with cursus; ani-cli's own -U self-update is
 not needed.
